    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> A living Flash Mob thrall activated by @UUID[Compendium.astillon-hanaq-adventures-module.astillon-blaster-items.Item.BlasterCommand01]{Command Flash Mob}.</p>\n<p><strong>Duration</strong> until the start of Blaster's next turn</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The thrall emits a 60-foot aura granting @UUID[Compendium.astillon-hanaq-adventures-module.astillon-blaster-items.Item.BlasterInspire01]{Inspire} only to its summoning Blaster. No other creature benefits.</p>\n<p>The benefit applies only while Blaster is within 60 feet of the thrall.</p>\n<p>The aura and its benefits end if the thrall is destroyed or removed.</p>",
